                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "646bda9f-36a1-3488-9433-118245fdc07e",
                        "entry_id": "ebf772cc-88e6-3344-9e47-2bc38ca2001d",
                        "glosses": [
                            "trzeci z przedżołądków przeżuwaczy"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f4dcda9d-3213-4f71-8b2d-f38366336448",
                                "sense_id": "646bda9f-36a1-3488-9433-118245fdc07e",
                                "text": "Księgi mają kształt okrągłego, nieco spłaszczonego worka"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6c8216cb-12bc-4fe5-9f48-7e52810128a7",
                        "source_entry_id": "ebf772cc-88e6-3344-9e47-2bc38ca2001d",
                        "source_sense_id": "646bda9f-36a1-3488-9433-118245fdc07e",
                        "target_lang_word": "omasum",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "omasum",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f021d023-66ba-3b08-8c91-58ee71c6814f",
                                        "entry_id": "4bf422ba-72a3-36df-8c68-b748063c57f0",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The third compartment of the stomach of a ruminant; the lining of said compartment, regarded as a foodstuff."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fbeabe49-7e85-40a6-8788-79772948926f",
                                                "sense_id": "f021d023-66ba-3b08-8c91-58ee71c6814f",
                                                "text": "The deer of the northern group are larger in body size and have well-developed rumino-reticulums, smaller omasums, and longer small intestines (Takatsuki 1988)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b219238-467f-40bb-8a00-8dd78074dc74",
                                                "sense_id": "f021d023-66ba-3b08-8c91-58ee71c6814f",
                                                "text": "The omasum is a spherical organ filled with muscular laminae (an estimated 90 to 130 in the bovine omasum) that lie in sheets, much like the pages of a book (giving the omasum its colloquial name, book stomach)."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "595a79f6-c932-4bd5-aae7-52a53779d3c1",
                                                "sense_id": "f021d023-66ba-3b08-8c91-58ee71c6814f",
                                                "text": "The role of the omasum is not entirely clear. The organ fills with very fluid digesta leaving the reticulo-rumen, but omasal contents are very dry and tightly compacted. Clearly, fluid absorption takes place in the omasum and in cattle, water, electrolytes and VFA^([volatile fatty acids]) are absorbed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a7e060b3-f2f9-414d-8159-56099d463a28",
                                                "sense_id": "f021d023-66ba-3b08-8c91-58ee71c6814f",
                                                "text": "Finally, grazers, with the higher fluid throughput through the reticulorumen, require larger omasa (Table 4.6)—with the main function of omasa being the resorption of fluid, to prevent too diluted digesta reaching the sites of auto-enzymatic digestion (Clauss et al. 2006)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7f528fd4-9a76-45cf-8e59-1b1e7e891846",
                        "source_entry_id": "ebf772cc-88e6-3344-9e47-2bc38ca2001d",
                        "source_sense_id": "646bda9f-36a1-3488-9433-118245fdc07e",
                        "target_lang_word": "feuillet",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "feuillet",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ef1eedab-ac51-31bc-8674-c9571e2c3fbf",
                                        "entry_id": "d6f92d4a-7052-348f-bea9-1d591e6e88bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Chaque partie d’une feuille de papier qui a été pliée ou coupée en deux, en quatre, en huit, etc., en vue d’y écrire, d’y imprimer ou d’y dessiner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "debdfe52-9730-4b33-9456-d76f49af0e38",
                                                "sense_id": "ef1eedab-ac51-31bc-8674-c9571e2c3fbf",
                                                "text": "Nul bruit, si ce n'est le froissement de feuillets de vélin sous les doigts du docteur Huylten."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea29ae80-e4e2-4975-8015-736105a93580",
                                                "sense_id": "ef1eedab-ac51-31bc-8674-c9571e2c3fbf",
                                                "text": "Sur un troisième et un quatrième feuillet, il y avait deux dessins au trait représentant, l'un l'intérieur d'une chambre, l'autre un jardin planté d'arbres."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86095c8f-36cf-47eb-b87a-80f9b93a0b09",
                                                "sense_id": "ef1eedab-ac51-31bc-8674-c9571e2c3fbf",
                                                "text": "À propos de Modeste Mignon, il annonce joyeusement à son amie : « Encore soixante-dix feuillets de mon écriture... Ce sera fini demain. »"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e5f34cd5-f6be-3831-a843-ffa76e0ba5c3",
                                        "entry_id": "d6f92d4a-7052-348f-bea9-1d591e6e88bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Feuille, lame."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "analogy"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7373b45e-15ba-3e85-8623-df2d31e64619",
                                        "entry_id": "d6f92d4a-7052-348f-bea9-1d591e6e88bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Chacune des lames qui garnissent le dessous du chapeau des agarics."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9e28b45e-a898-369b-b8e8-6a7fa4d0b85b",
                                        "entry_id": "d6f92d4a-7052-348f-bea9-1d591e6e88bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Troisième estomac des ruminants, qui est tapissé de follicules."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eed29c11-f28d-4028-b954-48691da357ad",
                                                "sense_id": "9e28b45e-a898-369b-b8e8-6a7fa4d0b85b",
                                                "text": "Les aliments transitent ensuite du rumen dans le feuillet où se fait l’absorption de l’eau."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "00fe1cb3-78b4-3c53-8bfa-29566c28c937",
                                        "entry_id": "d6f92d4a-7052-348f-bea9-1d591e6e88bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Planche mince destinée à servir de panneau."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f2fab96b-2b9d-498d-85e6-d7eeb2b7e0df",
                                                "sense_id": "00fe1cb3-78b4-3c53-8bfa-29566c28c937",
                                                "text": "Elle remarqua qu’il avait pris soin de cacher le lit derrière un de ces paravents à feuillets gaiement historiés."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "34defab5-b900-3a4b-82c0-02279f5ea248",
                                        "entry_id": "d6f92d4a-7052-348f-bea9-1d591e6e88bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Feuille."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "780c9289-c6ac-4650-936c-865e12093013",
                                                "sense_id": "34defab5-b900-3a4b-82c0-02279f5ea248",
                                                "text": "Le schiste ardoisier doit ses applications à sa remarquable fissilité ; il peut se fendre en feuillets aussi minces qu’on le désire."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e847e617-b3ad-307c-a46f-3961a40ebc49",
                                        "entry_id": "d6f92d4a-7052-348f-bea9-1d591e6e88bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Scie tournante utilisée par les tonneliers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Tonnellerie"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fec3415d-1f68-3afa-9b98-650e3243e08e",
                                        "entry_id": "d6f92d4a-7052-348f-bea9-1d591e6e88bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Rouleau de laine prête à être filée."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c5013bce-1486-3da4-adbb-ad7a65e45290",
                                        "entry_id": "d6f92d4a-7052-348f-bea9-1d591e6e88bd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Peau de veau autrefois utilisée pour fixer les pointes sur les machines à carder."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f599094e-258b-325b-8822-9d70f6ba55d1",
